This is my personal website. I am Casey Walker.

To build, both MkDocs and MkDocs Material are needed.

If using `pipx` for installing Python programs:
  # pipx install mkdocs
  # pipx inject mkdocs mkdocs-material

Links:
  - MkDocs: https://github.com/mkdocs/mkdocs
  - MkDocs material: https://github.com/squidfunk/mkdocs-material

Then just run `just build`, and the website will be created in 'build/'.
